{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance","content_id":"5964084d-cb46-4089-8be5-e6e9d5ae57c2","description":"Immigration staff guide for how UK Visas and Immigration considers applications to enter or remain in the UK on the Global Business Mobility routes.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9424550","isbn":"","title":"Global Business Mobility routes caseworker guidance (accessible)","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance-accessible"},{"accessible":false,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternativeformats@homeoffice.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a6b26b0862aaf18d9c62a17","filename":"Global_Business_Mobility_routes_guidance.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":801384,"filename":"Global_Business_Mobility_routes_guidance.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9424551","isbn":"","number_of_pages":78,"title":"Global Business Mobility routes caseworker guidance","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a6b26b0862aaf18d9c62a17/Global_Business_Mobility_routes_guidance.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This guidance tells caseworkers how to consider applications from existing workers of overseas businesses with a presence in the UK who wish to enter or remain in the UK to work under the Global Business Mobility routes of the points-based system.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Updated the Part Suitability section with information on immigration bail.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-02T23:01:01Z"},{"note":"Updated to include an additional trade agreement.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-14T23:01:05Z"},{"note":"Updated to version 13.0 of the guidance. ","public_timestamp":"2026-04-08T06:00:10Z"},{"note":"Added a table for CoS assigned from 16 December 2025 to the Immigration Skills Charge section.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-16T01:00:00Z"},{"note":"This guidance has been updated to reflect the replacement of ‘Part 9: grounds for refusal’ with ‘Part Suitability’ in the Immigration Rules.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-11T00:01:01Z"},{"note":"Updated the 'Proof of immigration status' section to reflect eVisa rollout and decommissioning of 90-day vignettes for former Biometric Residence Permit (BRP) routes, updated salary thresholds for Senior and Specialist Worker, UK Expansion Worker and Graduate Trainee.","public_timestamp":"2025-07-22T10:50:25Z"},{"note":"Guidance updated as detailed on page 7. ","public_timestamp":"2025-02-27T17:00:08Z"},{"note":"Published version 8 of the Global Business Mobility routes caseworker guidance. The full list of changes can be found in the document. ","public_timestamp":"2024-04-03T23:10:01Z"},{"note":"Added guidance on genuineness rules that apply to all Global Business Mobility applications submitted on or after 7 August 2023.","public_timestamp":"2023-08-06T23:01:12Z"},{"note":"Updated with guidance on the new validity requirement for applicants who have or last had permission as a student and to clarify the names of Swiss qualifications that are considered to be equivalent to a UK degree in the Service Supplier route.","public_timestamp":"2023-07-17T14:00:04Z"},{"note":"Guidance updated to reflect that the Australia and New Zealand Free Trade Agreements are now in force and to add further Swiss qualifications that are considered to be equivalent to a UK degree in the Service Supplier route.","public_timestamp":"2023-05-31T08:00:03Z"},{"note":"Updated the guidance in line with changes to the Immigration Rules. ","public_timestamp":"2023-04-12T08:00:00Z"},{"note":"Updated the caseworker guidance to reflect changes to the Immigration Skills Charge Regulations.","public_timestamp":"2023-01-01T00:15:13Z"},{"note":"Updated guidance to reflect changes to the Immigration Rules. ","public_timestamp":"2022-11-09T00:15:04Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2022-04-10T23:00:00Z"}],"document_type_label":"Guidance","emphasised_organisations":["06056197-bc69-4147-aa28-070bca132178","04148522-b0c1-4137-b687-5f3c3bdd561a"],"featured_attachments":["9424550","9424551"],"first_public_at":"2022-04-11T00:00:00.000+01:00","political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"guidance","first_published_at":"2022-04-11T00:00:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance","base_path":"/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance","content_id":"5964084d-cb46-4089-8be5-e6e9d5ae57c2","document_type":"guidance","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-02T23:01:01Z","schema_name":"publication","title":"Global Business Mobility routes caseworker guidance","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance","withdrawn":false}],"children":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance-accessible","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance-accessible","base_path":"/government/publications/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance/global-business-mobility-routes-caseworker-guidance-accessible","content_id":"686d4d66-9eb8-4d32-b3e2-b27c859f154f","document_type":"html_publication","links":{"parent":[{"api_path":"/api/conte